@ 18.1.2 - Pre-Bakairi to Western Bakairi
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Meira, Sérgio (2005), “Reconstructing Pre-Bakairi Segmental Phonology”. Anthropological Linguistics 47(3):261 – 291
	V:[-stress]NV > ṼṼ
	z > h / V_a
	z > ∅ / V_V
	C:[+fricative -voiced] > ∅ / ʔ_
	ɨ > ə / P_
	ɨ > i
	ʒ > ∅
	ɾ > ∅ / V_V, where at least one of the vowels is nasalized